{"task_id": "Mbpp/2", "solution": "def _compute_intersection(seq1, seq2):\n    \"\"\"Internal helper; returns list of unique shared elements using a hash-based intersection algorithm.\"\"\"\n    set1 = set(seq1)\n    set2 = set(seq2)\n    common_elements_set = set1.intersection(set2)\n    return list(common_elements_set)\n\ndef similar_elements(seq1, seq2):\n    \"\"\"Accept exactly two sequence inputs and return an iterable (list) of unique shared elements.\"\"\"\n    return _compute_intersection(seq1, seq2)"}
