{"task_id": "Mbpp/89", "solution": "import math\nfrom typing import Union\n\ndef closest_num(n: Union[int, float]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the largest integer strictly less than n.\n    If n is an integer or has no fractional part, returns n - 1; otherwise, returns floor(n).\n    \"\"\"\n    if n == math.floor(n):\n        return int(n) - 1\n    else:\n        return math.floor(n)"}
