{"task_id": "Mbpp/108", "solution": "def merge_sorted_list(list1, list2, list3):\n    \"\"\"Merges three lists into a single sorted list.\n    It concatenates the input lists and then sorts the combined elements.\"\"\"\n\n    def _concatenate(l1, l2, l3):\n        \"\"\"Concatenates three lists into a single new list, preserving duplicates.\"\"\"\n        return l1 + l2 + l3\n\n    def _sortAscending(seq):\n        \"\"\"Sorts a list of integers in ascending order and returns a new list.\"\"\"\n        return sorted(seq)\n\n    # Input validation as described in the design context is omitted due to constraints.\n\n    concatenated_list = _concatenate(list1, list2, list3)\n    sorted_list = _sortAscending(concatenated_list)\n\n    return sorted_list"}
